01:09:26,666 --> 01:09:32,666
Rescue Dawn is a 2006 epic war drama film written and directed by Werner Herzog.

11
01:16:23,333 --> 01:16:29,333
It is based on the true story of Dieter Dengler, played by Christian Bale, a German-American pilot who was shot down and
captured by villagers sympathetic to the Pathet Lao during an American military campaign in the Vietnam War.

12
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
Steve Zahn, Jeremy Davies, and Toby Huss have
prominent supporting roles in the film.

13
01:30:16,666 --> 01:30:22,666
In 1997, Herzog made a documentary film about Dengler
titled Little Dieter Needs to Fly.

14
01:37:13,333 --> 01:37:19,333
Rescue Dawn, which focuses on Dengler's experiences as a prisoner
of war, began shooting in Thailand in August 2005.

15
01:44:10,000 --> 01:44:16,000
It received critical acclaim, but was a box office failure.

16
01:51:06,666 --> 01:51:12,666
The film explores themes of vietnam war, escape, war
crimes, prisoner of war, based on true story.

17
01:58:03,333 --> 01:58:09,333
The tone is emotional.
